  - `m_solver`: Solver used to solve the equations of motion.
- **Methods**:
  - `Add(body)`: Adds a body to the system.
  - `SetupInitial()`: Sets up the initial state of the system.
  - `DoStepDynamics(time_step)`: Advances the system forward in time by one step.

