## Classes and Structs

### Class: `OLED12864`
The `OLED12864` class encapsulates the functionality required to interact with an OLED display. It manages the display settings, cursor position, and font information.

#### Fields/Member Variables
- `_i2cAddress`: The I2C address of the OLED display.
- `_directDraw`: A flag indicating whether direct drawing mode is enabled.
- `_enableBuffer`: A flag indicating whether buffering is enabled.
- `_buffer`: A buffer used for storing display data when buffering is enabled.
